# 行尾与二进制策略
#
# 仓库里同时有 TS/JSON/YAML/Markdown 与截图，不统一行尾时不同编辑器会造出
# 整文件 diff（只改了行尾），review 与 blame 都被污染。这里在 git 层统一：
# 仓库内存 LF，Windows 检出也用 LF（CI 都跑 Linux）。

* text=auto

*.ts     text eol=lf
*.tsx    text eol=lf
*.js     text eol=lf
*.mjs    text eol=lf
*.cjs    text eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
*.yml    text eol=lf
*.yaml   text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.css    text eol=lf
*.html   text eol=lf
*.sh     text eol=lf
*.example text eol=lf
Dockerfile        text eol=lf
docker-compose.yml text eol=lf
LICENSE  text eol=lf
NOTICE   text eol=lf

# Preserve the upstream SPDX text byte-for-byte; its first line includes a space.
licenses/BSD-3-Clause.txt whitespace=-blank-at-eol

# 二进制资源不做行尾转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
